in the past, finance was only available through brokers and in specific geographical regions, however, with tokenizing rwas, global markets become just as easy to send as sending $usdc.

{ $usc is an example of what a serious defi stablecoin looks like, it's fully collateralized by swiss banks and aims to combine the benefits of real banking with on-chain liquidity}

the rwa is not merely a hype, however, it is revenue, compliance and real collateral being used at the speed of the blockchain, therefore the next cycle of crypto will revolve around real assets rather than created fictional narratives

